00:53:09.560 --> 00:53:14.800
A lot of people loved this turn of events of Michael starting his paper company and Pam

1235
00:53:14.800 --> 00:53:15.580
going with him.

1236
00:53:15.580 --> 00:53:21.780
But other people really thought that it was selfish of Pam to quit without talking to Jim

1237
00:53:21.780 --> 00:53:22.580
firSt.

1238
00:53:23.220 --> 00:53:26.480
Well, we talked to Aaron Schur about this, and he said two things.

1239
00:53:27.240 --> 00:53:35.140
First of all, he said, in a future episode, spoiler alert, Vikram from the telemarketing

1240
00:53:35.140 --> 00:53:37.840
firm is going to join Michael Scott Paper Company.

1241
00:53:37.840 --> 00:53:38.380
Yes.

1242
00:53:38.600 --> 00:53:45.060
