1249
00:54:08.120 --> 00:54:08.760
Yeah.

1250
00:54:09.020 --> 00:54:09.320
Right?

1251
00:54:09.560 --> 00:54:09.880
Yeah.

1252
00:54:11.080 --> 00:54:18.140
There was also a line that Aaron wrote to explain this business of Pam not talking to

1253
00:54:18.140 --> 00:54:23.860
Jim before making this decision, a little couplet of dialogue that got cut, where Jim said

1254
00:54:23.860 --> 00:54:26.720
